# Athenura Billing System

Athenura is a billing management system developed to manage billing operations efficiently.
The application helps manage products, customers and generate billing records with PDF generation support.

## Technologies Used

- Java
- Spring Boot
- Spring Data JPA
- Hibernate
- MySQL
- REST API
- Cloudinary API
- Spring Security
- Java Mail

## Features

- Manage product details
- Manage customer details
- Create and manage billing records
- Generate PDF invoices
- Upload and manage files using Cloudinary
- Store and retrieve billing information
- CRUD operations using REST APIs
- Secure API access
- Email functionality for sending notifications

## Project Structure

The application follows layered architecture:

Controller Layer  
- Handles API requests and responses

Service Layer  
- Contains business logic

Repository Layer  
- Handles database operations

Entity Layer  
- Represents database models

